# Emulator: the paks are virtio disks and the initramfs has already mounted them at
# /mnt/tvservice, /mnt/otncabi, /mnt/otycabi, /mnt/fonts, /mnt/smartkey and /mnt/license.
# /mnt/lg/ciplus/cert (mmcblk0p14) has no pak in the firmware and is left empty. (W16R's stock
# fstab: p14, p28 and p30-p33, p35.) The bind fstabs of this directory (fonts, otycabi, smartkey,
# tvservice) are the stock ones.
